/S /H1
/T (As we closed 2024, we reflected with pride on the milestones achieved and the shared purpose that drives our work in Nepal. This year, we expanded our footprint into new study sites, primarily in Koshi and Madhesh provinces. Our expansion enables us to advance formative research, co-design and pilot targeted interventions, and convert promising results into larger trials. A significant focus has been on strengthening and innovating community health systems in collaboration with local partners including federal and local governments, and Dhulikhel Hospital, Kathmandu University Hospital. )
/E (As we closed 2024, we reflected with pride on the milestones achieved and the shared purpose that drives our work in Nepal. This year, we expanded our footprint into new study sites, primarily in Koshi and Madhesh provinces. Our expansion enables us to advance formative research, co-design and pilot targeted interventions, and convert promising results into larger trials. A significant focus has been on strengthening and innovating community health systems in collaboration with local partners including federal and local governments, and Dhulikhel Hospital, Kathmandu University Hospital. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
