/T (Participants recommended several strategies to improve dementia care, such as raising awareness through media and community health workers, expanding government insurance programs, providing specialized training for health workers, and prioritizing family-centered care and rehabilitation programs. Based on these findings, we aim to develop an innovative and scalable intervention to support health workers and caregivers of people with dementia in Nepal.)
/E (Participants recommended several strategies to improve dementia care, such as raising awareness through media and community health workers, expanding government insurance programs, providing specialized training for health workers, and prioritizing family-centered care and rehabilitation programs. Based on these findings, we aim to develop an innovative and scalable intervention to support health workers and caregivers of people with dementia in Nepal.)
