/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Over the past three years, Possible, through implementation research, has collaborated with the MoHP, in particular the NSSD, to generate evidence supporting the scale-up of community health programs in two municipalities. While there remain areas for further improvement and iteration in the program such as refining workflow design for care delivery and strengthening supervisory system, our recent interim analysis shows a significant increase in institutional birth rates compared to baseline. )
/E (Over the past three years, Possible, through implementation research, has collaborated with the MoHP, in particular the NSSD, to generate evidence supporting the scale-up of community health programs in two municipalities. While there remain areas for further improvement and iteration in the program such as refining workflow design for care delivery and strengthening supervisory system, our recent interim analysis shows a significant increase in institutional birth rates compared to baseline. )
