/E (By addressing both mental health challenges like depression and the critical issue of intimate partner violence \(IPV\), MILAP seeks to empower women and families. The evidence generated through this trial will not only guide efforts to improve mental wellbeing and reduce IPV in Nepal but also offer hope for women in other countries facing similar struggles.)
